"""The roster of Wave102 (release 1.111.0, key `god_special_new`): 9 NEW God grade and 20 NEW Special grade relics. ONE table: gen102.py writes the Java, the lang fragment, the class
rows, the theme rows, the effect tables and the doc from it; weapons.py builds the 9 weapon meshes; worn.py / hand.py the worn and held models of the gear.

WEAPONS (kind melee | bow | shield): id, name, grade, cls (weapon class and GradeDamage type), speed, look, pal, theme (a mega-dungeon road), src (franchise), rule (the passive: Cond,
bonus, extras), attrs / resists / skills (the standing passives), lore, acts, engr (Tensura engravings), kind, doc.
GEAR (rows of relic_rows_lib.R): the same row format as the generated waves 31-46 (slot, look, grade, palette, icon, text, passives, acts), plus the franchise and the road in GEAR_META.
An act of a weapon: key, name, expr (a function from the damage helper D(k) to the Java expression of the body), cd (seconds), mana (percent), text, sneak, day.
"""
import os
import sys

